boxes-and-lines Pirate Fleet Command

tag Side as t
  Pirate green
  Navy red
  Smuggler yellow
  Harbor blue default

Flagship t: Pirate
  -orders-> [Harbor Defenses]
  -scouts-> IntelNetwork

[Harbor Defenses]
  FortCannon t: Harbor
    -covers-> Watchtower
  Watchtower t: Harbor
  SeaMines t: Harbor

IntelNetwork t: Pirate
  -hires-> SpyRing
  -reads-> SignalFlags

SpyRing t: Smuggler
  -warns-> [Harbor Defenses]

SignalFlags t: Pirate

NavyFrigate t: Navy
  -blockades-> [Harbor Defenses]
NavyCutter t: Navy
  -hunts-> SmugglerSloop
SmugglerSloop t: Smuggler
  -trades-> SpyRing
